# ==============================================================================
# RIFTBORN — Environment Variables Template (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# RIFTBORN is a client-side browser game (Vite + Vanilla JS).
# 
# CRITICAL VITE SECURITY RULE:
# Any variable prefixed with "VITE_" is embedded directly into the public client
# bundle and is visible to anyone inspecting the page.
# 
# NEVER put private API keys, database credentials, server secrets, or payment
# secret keys into .env or VITE_* variables.
# 
# Currently, RIFTBORN requires ZERO environment variables for offline/client play.
# ==============================================================================

# Public configuration example (optional, client-visible):
# VITE_APP_TITLE=RIFTBORN - Combat
# VITE_PUBLIC_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
